  {
   "id": "shogun-showdown-208533@major-2024-01-22",
   "gameId": "shogun-showdown-208533",
   "displayName": "New update + price increase!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-01-22T18:12:09.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As part of the Pirates vs Ninjas Fest, we have a new update available for you now, which we are detailing just below.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "We would also like to let you know that we will update Shogun Showdown's pricing in a week, moving from $9.99 / €9.99 to $14.99 / €14.99.",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The reason we are doing this is that we believe the game's current content and replayability justify such a price. Considering we will also add more content for the 1.0 launch and continue supporting the game afterward to make it the most complete game possible.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That's why we have applied a 30% discount to the game, so this is your last chance to grab it at this price for a while.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We hope you will understand our decision, which we truly believe is fair.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "New Content",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Corrupted Bosses may appear from Day 4 (new ascension level)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Locations: Forsaken Grounds and Theatre of Illusions",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Enemies: Warden, Blight Charger, Strider, Kabukai",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Bosses: Fumiko the Fallen and Sato the Stagemaster",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Consumables: Rain of Mirrors and Lucky Die",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Skills: Close Combat, Central Dominion, Kobushi Combo, Combo Boon, Chilling Blood, Iron Skin, Mamushi Move, Chikara Crush",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Tiles: Back Shadow Dash, Mon, Twin Tessen, Sai, Blazing Suisei",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Lore: boss barks.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Tweaks and balance",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Rearranged Day Buffs (ascension). Day 2: elite enemies, Day 3: lower consumable drops.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cooldown upgrade in shop: from -1CD 15$ to -2CD 20$",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tiles are now grouped into \"common\" and \"uncommon\". Uncommon tiles have lower probability of being rewarded.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Monomancer: reduced max skill level to 1.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Buffed Knockback Punch: from 5CD to 4CD",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Buffed Cursing Move skill: no longer increases special move CD by 1.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Iwao is now freezable. Nobunaga is now unfreezable.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added visual effect when a skill is triggered.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reworked stamps display, added \"days completion marks\".",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
