    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey there!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Pushing some fixes live since they were potentially softlocking the game :",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixing an issue with the gamepad in the shop ending up in stucking the selector and softlocking the game unless played with mouse-keyboard. This was mostly linked to sacrifying a tile in the shop",
