  {
   "id": "shogun-showdown-208533@major-2023-07-03",
   "gameId": "shogun-showdown-208533",
   "displayName": "Shogun Showdown's Cloud update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-07-03T09:05:55.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We had issues with the Steam Cloud. Long story short, it only worked between the same OS, and, only the metaprogression was saved. But if you stopped mid-run to continue on another computer, you'd have to start your run over again",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "From now on, you should be able to keep your save and ongoing run saved to the cloud, no matter which OS you use!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The main use-case of this would be with the Steamdeck, being able to save and quit on PC then continue your run on Steamdeck.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Talking about Steamdeck, someone in the team made an unofficial gamepad layout, so you've got a layout to play with before the official gamepad support comes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Have a fantastic week!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
